Electron adaptation notes (44-x-y):
This branch does not have the StoreICMode plumbing introduced by crrev.com/c/8256841, so the StoreICMode parameter is threaded through HandleStoreICSmiHandlerCase(), HandleStoreFieldAndReturn() and CheckHeapObjectTypeMatchesDescriptor() here (plus a StoreICParameters::mode() accessor) exactly as upstream has it, so the kDefineNamedOwnInLiteral checks can be applied verbatim. The upstream hunk touching the maybe_initializing_store switch was dropped because that switch does not exist on this branch. Reviewer attention requested.

